		"description": "<p>When traveling with animals that are carrying objects, you may stow an extra amount of supply equal to your proficiency bonus. If the animals are pulling a cart or wagon, you may also stow two extra bulky items and double your proficiency bonus in supply. In either case, the animal is not treated as encumbered.</p>",
